{"attribution":"Federal Emergency Management Agency, Ready.gov, Tornadoes for Kids, Simplified Chinese; no FEMA, DHS, or U.S. Government endorsement or affiliation is implied.","cases":[{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-kids-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-001","input":"龙卷风是自然界最猛烈的风暴。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/kids/disaster-facts/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-001","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-kids-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-002","input":"它们看起来像漏斗或锥形云，风速超过每小时 200 英里。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/kids/disaster-facts/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-002","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-kids-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-003","input":"龙卷风警示：当恶劣天气可能导致龙卷风形成时发出的警告。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/kids/disaster-facts/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-003","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-kids-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-004","input":"这意味着您应该关注电视、广播，并确保打开天气广播。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/kids/disaster-facts/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-004","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-kids-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-005","input":"确保您的手机可以接收无线紧急警报。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/kids/disaster-facts/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-005","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-kids-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-006","input":"龙卷风警告：龙卷风警告意味着已经发现龙卷风，或者多普勒雷达显示可能引发龙卷风的雷暴环流。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/kids/disaster-facts/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-006","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-kids-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-007","input":"当您的城镇或县发布龙卷风警告时，您应该立即找到一个安全的避难所。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/kids/disaster-facts/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-007","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-kids-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-008","input":"漏斗云：一种长云形状，顶部较宽，底部较细，像冰淇淋甜筒。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/kids/disaster-facts/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-008","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-kids-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-009","input":"如果天气条件合适，龙卷风可能随时随地发生。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/kids/disaster-facts/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-009","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-kids-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-010","input":"在美国，落基山脉以东的中部地区平均遭遇龙卷风的次数最多。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/kids/disaster-facts/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-010","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-kids-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-011","input":"但是，风险在每个季节都会发生变化。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/kids/disaster-facts/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-011","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-kids-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-012","input":"冬季，从路易斯安那州到乔治亚州的墨西哥湾沿岸州平均遭遇龙卷风的次数最多。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/kids/disaster-facts/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-012","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-kids-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-013","input":"春季，该地区转移到德克萨斯州中北部和俄克拉荷马州。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/kids/disaster-facts/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-013","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-kids-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-014","input":"到夏季，风险区域向北移动到中部和北部平原。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/kids/disaster-facts/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-014","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-kids-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-015","input":"秋季，风险区域向南移动，从德克萨斯州东部延伸到密西西比州。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/kids/disaster-facts/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-015","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-kids-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-016","input":"最后，风险区域在冬季回到墨西哥湾沿岸各州。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/kids/disaster-facts/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-016","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-kids-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-017","input":"帮助家人准备应急包。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/kids/disaster-facts/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-017","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-kids-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-018","input":"如果您有宠物，请确保包括它们需要的东西。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/kids/disaster-facts/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-018","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-kids-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-019","input":"制定家庭沟通计划。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/kids/disaster-facts/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-019","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-kids-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-020","input":"计划在龙卷风来袭时停电或不在家时如何与家人沟通。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/kids/disaster-facts/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-020","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-kids-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-021","input":"了解龙卷风的迹象，包括旋转的漏斗状云、接近的碎石云或货运火车般的巨响。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/kids/disaster-facts/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-021","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-kids-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-022","input":"练习与父母和宠物一起去安全的地方。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/kids/disaster-facts/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-022","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-kids-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-023","input":"这可能是地下室、地窖或建筑物中最低的洪水区。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/kids/disaster-facts/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-023","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-kids-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-024","input":"如果您没有地下室，请去壁橱或走廊等室内房间。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/kids/disaster-facts/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-024","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-kids-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-025","input":"如果您住在移动房屋中，如果您所在的地区处于龙卷风警报之下，选择安全的地方（如坚固的建筑物或风暴避难所）很重要。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/kids/disaster-facts/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-025","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-kids-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-026","input":"如果您无法到达更安全的地方，请在沟渠中趴着并用手护住头部。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/kids/disaster-facts/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-026","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-kids-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-027","input":"穿上结实的鞋子。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/kids/disaster-facts/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-027","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-kids-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-028","input":"如果您有自行车头盔，请戴上它以保护您的头部。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/kids/disaster-facts/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-028","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-kids-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-029","input":"立即前往家人选择的安全地点，如果有时间，请带上您的宠物。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/kids/disaster-facts/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-029","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-kids-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-030","input":"听从父母、看护人或老师的指示。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/kids/disaster-facts/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-030","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-kids-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-031","input":"用手臂遮住头部或颈部，并在身上或身上盖上毯子等物品，以保护自己。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/kids/disaster-facts/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-031","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-kids-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-032","input":"如果您在车里，请下车进入坚固的建筑物。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/kids/disaster-facts/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-032","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-kids-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-033","input":"如果您能看到龙卷风，而且距离很远，交通不繁忙，您可以以与龙卷风成直角的方向驶离龙卷风的路径。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/kids/disaster-facts/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-033","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-kids-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-034","input":"如果您在龙卷风期间被困在车里，无法安全离开，请系好安全带留在车里。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/kids/disaster-facts/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-034","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-kids-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-035","input":"将头放在窗户下方，用手和毯子、外套或其他垫子（如果可能）遮住头部。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/kids/disaster-facts/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-035","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-kids-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-036","input":"避免在桥下寻找避难所，因为桥下可能会造成交通危险，并且无法提供足够的保护。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/kids/disaster-facts/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-036","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-kids-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-037","input":"如果已经损坏，请远离并听从成人的指示。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/kids/disaster-facts/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-037","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-kids-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-038","input":"不要触摸电线等裸露的电线。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/kids/disaster-facts/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-038","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-kids-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-039","input":"如果您闻到煤气味，请告诉您的父母。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/kids/disaster-facts/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-039","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-kids-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-040","input":"您可以帮助您的父母或护理人员联系您的亲人，让他们知道您没事。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/kids/disaster-facts/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-040","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-kids-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-041","input":"知道感到焦虑或压力是正常的。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/kids/disaster-facts/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-041","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-kids-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-042","input":"每个人对压力情况的反应都不同。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/kids/disaster-facts/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-042","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-kids-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1/sentence-043","input":"照顾好自己的身体，如果您感到不安，请与您的父母或其他可信赖的成年人交谈。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/kids/disaster-facts/tornadoes","source_case_id":"sentence-043","split":"article"}}],"converter_output_used":false,"dataset":"blind-v2","id":"ready-gov-kids-tornadoes-zh-hans-v1","input_only":true,"license":"U.S. Public Domain","modification_notice":"Extracted only complete Simplified Chinese paragraph and list-item sentences from the checksum-pinned Ready.gov main element, removed navigation, images, external resources, phone/URL instructions, page furniture, and exact duplicates, and added input-only provenance; no expected text or converter output was used.","purpose":"candidate_source_pilot","review_policy":"domain_and_risk_must_be_assigned_from_input_only","source_class":"public_domain","stats":{"by_split":{"article":43},"eligible_pending_review":43,"exclusions":{},"raw_cases":43},"upstream_revision":"Ready.gov Simplified Chinese Tornadoes for Kids; page last updated 2025-10-29; retrieved HTML SHA-256: cebac3d7aff4f55ee1e1af4b148aa4b87f9b3fa1d9e4b762d064f15e968f89b0","version":1}
